t":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4605529324","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119805#issuecomment-4605529324","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119805","id":4605529324,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEoLM7A","user":{"login":"collmut","id":56034539,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MDM0NTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56034539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/collmut","html_url":"https://github.com/collmut","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/collmut/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/collmut/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/collmut/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/collmut/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/collmut/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/collmut/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/collmut/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/collmut/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/collmut/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-02T17:57:07Z","updated_at":"2026-06-02T17:57:07Z","body":"> also get_active_material(0).next_pass.set('no_depth_test',true) on enter makes it work as expected\n\nMy specific use case hinders me from setting the material property through code because the stencil effect is applied to separate mesh parts of an imported 3d model which has names that can change any time.\n\nMy work around is : Converting the StandardMaterial3D to a ShaderMaterial by right clicking on the mesh material resource then \"Convert To Shader Material\" and saving the shader resource to disk for reuse. You can then apply this stencil material shader to any materials that need no_depth_test on the next pass material.\n\nThis works fine for the moment.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4605529324/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]